  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reinforcement of UNDSS capacity in support of humanitarian organizations to enable safe programme delivery in Sudan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This CS-Safety and Security project focuses on deployment of critical security assets - of 6 Armoured Vehicle (AV) with 6 drivers to enhance safe conduct of humanitarian operations in Sudan. The assets will be used to rebuild the UNDSS security structure in the field, conduct security assessment, joint missions, extraction of humanitarian personnel which will facilitate rapid security risk management analysis in areas identified as high priorities for humanitarian operations, provide increased analytical and operational capability, crisis readiness and operational support for the scaled-up humanitarian operations across Sudan. The agency will also conduct field security monitoring missions and produce SRAs/SRMs.</narrative>
  </description>
